  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support BRAC Institute of Governance and Development to develop expertise and advocate for policy action</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FCDO will work directly with 3-4 think-tanks and BIGD is one of them.  This route will cost less and offer more engagement and visibility of UK International Development than working through management consultancy companies.  We will also seek to establish pooled funding arrangements with other development partners.</narrative>
  </description>
